{"data":{"codec":"utf8","content_ref":"inline:SRC_008 (claiming $1,269) contradicts SRC_005, SRC_009, and SRC_006 because it applies the overtime rate to all 47 hours (47×$27=$1,269) rather than only to hours beyond 40. This abstracts to a category error in overtime scope: conflating 'overtime rate for overtime hours' with 'overtime rate for all hours.' It is refuted if the problem statement specifies that overtime applies only to hours exceeding 40, which all other accepted artifacts confirm.","id":"eb8832a1390169fddea7cc7f4057a518c95646d95c61b3625f239ed7aa58914e","interface":{"commitments":["hv-floor@2a45b7988522","lineage-ref@b1001379fc5e","relation-form@578e42df713e"],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"274e86c9d466f25c4821662e2b997e5437b5480a03f8fe140326b08e8222d880"},{"role":"dependence","target":"4ad41b445bcbb8d250c42180c4c682a709d65af213b90b3f5c44d19c0952d0da"},{"role":"dependence","target":"65578ae9a1cd69cd592cc933232f6ee201ecc7c5429239c23cf0ef50d0e4a4ae"},{"role":"dependence","target":"97a7bd6f0309ef4d763576b38e43ac867484100376a4d6d498d312a863bc1ed9"},{"role":"dependence","target":"d956e16e09ac5db972cf421a2986a72bed3b9e0aec949a7bde0f526d0b8d0529"},{"role":"dependence","target":"30be11905db881ea7a4e488a8e68f34e4f6b262380bb3b1a31ceb9763a9aea81"},{"role":"dependence","target":"f98c29be917a8ea6403a56e847609b5bb809d0ae029d96b8ce9f5eb0a2daf32b"},{"role":"dependence","target":"9b5c22ef631a4414068b3ab2be2b69388b708995577af02310f9d73e0560f2ee"}]},"provenance":{"event_seq":1078,"role":"conjecturer","school":"school-2"},"warrants":[]},"id":"eb8832a1390169fddea7cc7f4057a518c95646d95c61b3625f239ed7aa58914e","schema":"artifact"}